sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-eryops-megacephalus-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-eryops-megacephalus-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-eryops-megacephalus-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Eryops megacephalus Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 127 µm (Cisuralian, 295 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 84.3/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 1 overall 84.3/100. The Schnakenberg critical-wavenumber law is in the script and the dispersion correlation on modes m=2..16 is r=0.99999998, but the published composite still modulates the gallery wall (unmasked cv_sim_similarity 94.4) and the audit does not yet credit the bone mask, the KS/RMSE report, or the negative controls as closed remediation. Overall 84.3/100 (faithfulness 82.7, reproducibility 88.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: python 3.12.3, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.18.1, matplotlib 3.11.2, Pillow 13.0.0. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 90, Morphological realism / specimen match 78, Parameter expressivity 84, Morphometric validation 80, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 88. Output judged: docs/media/eryops_megacephalus_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-eryops-megacephalus-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 561307 B, 1512×984 px, artifact_sha256 d39dec86b338897995a18611862cadc4735a89af83918444aa57064f98033d30 (sha256 d39dec86b338897995a18611862cadc4735a89af83918444aa57064f98033d30), spec_fingerprint 51cd1fdffca7c86caa7bb398d56aaa419b30f1491ad7e8b4fe11b7153e0b9b21. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 51cd1fdffca7c86caa7bb398d56aaa419b30f1491ad7e8b4fe11b7153e0b9b21; artifact_sha256: d39dec86b338897995a18611862cadc4735a89af83918444aa57064f98033d30; input_dataset_sha256: {eryops_megacephalus_amnh_specimen.jpg=11fc4e4eec64d5f1...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952: reaction-diffusion instabilities select a finite critical wavenumber k_c. | Schnakenberg 1979: the quadratic two-species system used as the kinetics. | Pawley and Warren 2006: Eryops megacephalus Cope, 1877 is an Early Permian eryopoid; this slot uses 295 Ma. | Witzmann et al. 2010: basal tetrapod dermal bone carries sculptured ornament.; reconstructed_in_script: Jacobian, k_c, and an explicit Euler Schnakenberg integrator on a 96x96 periodic patch with lambda_c fixed at 127 µm. | Pass-1 full-frame composite of that field onto the AMNH photograph (cv_sim_similarity 94.4).; transfer_boundary: 127 µm is the assigned primordium wavelength. The museum photograph cannot resolve it. | 8184 = 64*127+56 compares this wavelength to the 8.184 mm organ-scale pit, which is a different slot.; does_not_claim: That 127 µm pits were counted on the AMNH mount. | A later Eryops chronospecies. The series length is 1. | That the Pass-1 full-frame composite is the anatomical placement of the pigment.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "open need [morphometric_validation/morphometric-validation, pressure P=1.1]: Publish KS and RMSE for sigma(k) and non-circular specimen metrics.",
            "open need [parameter_sweep/parameter-expressivity, pressure P=1.1]: Show equal diffusion and autocatalysis ablation beside the diffusion-ratio sweep.",
            "open need [specimen_comparison/specimen-match, pressure P=1.5]: Restrict the 127 µm ocellus field to the eroded Otsu bone mask of the AMNH mount.",
            "remediation needed: Put the equal-diffusion and no-autocatalysis trajectories on the comparison figure.",
            "remediation needed: Report the KS statistic and RMSE of sigma(k) next to the Pearson correlation, and keep value != reference on the specimen metrics.",
            "remediation needed: Restrict the ocellus modulation to the eroded Otsu bone mask so the gallery wall is not painted.",
            "remediation needed: Write the measurements sidecar and rebuild the knowledge graph from this audit." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.843"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (primary assessor, loop 3222)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://x.ai> .
}

